      *       (C) Copyright Progressive Data Solutions, Inc., 1997         *
      *  AFTWDDDPO: Conversion query for new WDDDP                         *
      **********************************************************************
      *  DESCRIPTION:                                                      *
      *  This query produces a record count and amount billed,             *
      *  recovered and pending totals on the new file.                     *
      *                                                                    *
      *  CREATED: 12/17/97         PROGRAMMER: 84         PROJECT: 60ANY   *
      **********************************************************************
      *  REVISIONS:                                                        *
      *                                                                    *
      **********************************************************************
     A                                      REF(WDDDP)
     A          R PRTHDR                    SKIPB(2)           SPACEA(2)
     A            PTRDAT        10A        1
     A            PTTITL        50A       41
     A                                   125'Page'
     A            PTPAGE         4S 0    129                   EDTCDE(4)
     A            PTRTIM         8A        1SPACEB(1)          SPACEA(2)
     A                                     1'File:'
     A            PTQFIL        21A        7                   SPACEA(2)
     A                                     3'Company/Fund'
     A                                    +4'Year'
     A                                    +8'Count'
     A                                    +6'Billed Amt'
     A                                    +4'Recovered Amt'
     A                                    +6'Pending Amt'

      * Print totals on DDFYR break

     A          R PRTBK1                                       SPACEA(1)
     A            XXCO#     R              5REFFLD(DDCO#)      EDTCDE(3)
     A  61                                                     UNDERLINE
     A            XXFND     R             +4REFFLD(DDFND)      EDTCDE(3)
     A  61                                                     UNDERLINE
     A            XXFYR     R             +5REFFLD(DDFYR)      EDTCDE(3)
     A            XXCOUNT1       9S 0     +4                   EDTCDE(3)
     A  61                                                     UNDERLINE
     A            XXAMTB1   R   +2        +2REFFLD(DDAMTB)     EDTCDE(J)
     A  61                                                     UNDERLINE
     A            XXAMTR1   R   +2        +2REFFLD(DDAMTR)     EDTCDE(J)
     A  61                                                     UNDERLINE
     A            XXAMTP1   R   +2        +2REFFLD(DDAMTP)     EDTCDE(J)
     A  61                                                     UNDERLINE

      * Print totals on DDCO#/DDFND break

     A          R PRTBK2                                       SPACEA(2)
     A                                     1'*'
     A            XXCO#     R              5REFFLD(DDCO#)      EDTCDE(3)
     A            XXFND     R             +4REFFLD(DDFND)      EDTCDE(3)
     A            XXCOUNT2       9S 0    +12                   EDTCDE(3)
     A            XXAMTB2   R   +2        +2REFFLD(DDAMTB)     EDTCDE(J)
     A            XXAMTR2   R   +2        +2REFFLD(DDAMTR)     EDTCDE(J)
     A            XXAMTP2   R   +2        +2REFFLD(DDAMTP)     EDTCDE(J)

      * Print grand totals

     A          R PRTTOT                                       SPACEA(1)
     A                                     1'Grand totals:'
     A            XXCOUNT        9S 0    +13                   EDTCDE(3)
     A            XXAMTB    R   +2        +2REFFLD(DDAMTB)     EDTCDE(J)
     A            XXAMTR    R   +2        +2REFFLD(DDAMTR)     EDTCDE(J)
     A            XXAMTP    R   +2        +2REFFLD(DDAMTP)     EDTCDE(J)
